## ❌ Backend FastAPI — CHƯA DEPLOY

> [!CAUTION]
> Backend FastAPI **chưa được deploy** lên VPS Megahost_02. Đây là blocker chính.

### Trạng thái VPS Megahost_02
- **OS**: Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS
- **CPU**: 6.56% load | **RAM**: 26.63% used | **Disk**: 55.79% used
- **Đang chạy**: OpenClaw Gateway, CLIProxyAPI, Open WebUI, Qdrant, Docker
- **Không có**: `/opt/td-mailer-api/` directory, `td-mailer-api` service

### Cần triển khai trên VPS

```
/opt/td-mailer-api/
├── app.py              # FastAPI main
├── routes/
│   ├── leads.py        # POST /api/leads/discover
│   └── email.py        # POST /api/email/send
├── services/
│   ├── discovery.py    # Web scraping + Google CSE + SalesQL
│   ├── gmail_sender.py # Gmail API send + rate limit 30/day
│   └── supabase.py     # Update lead status
├── .env                # API keys (SalesQL, Google CSE, Supabase)
├── credentials/
│   └── gmail_token.json
└── requirements.txt
```

### Tính năng cần backend
1. **Lead Discovery**: Web scraping → Google CSE → SalesQL enrichment → 3-tier ranking
2. **Email Sending**: Gmail API qua `toan.dang@tdgamestudio.com`, sequence 3 bước
3. **Auto Follow-up**: Cron job gửi follow-up1 (Day 3) + follow-up2 (Day 7)
4. **Reply/Bounce Detection**: Webhook hoặc polling Gmail

